attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h5"},"pos":"220-13-14-14","docId":"75","text":"Appendix C: Cupertino Standard Detail 7-6 Sidewalk Sight Triangle (Sidewalk Clearance at Driveways).","id":"05721452-f665-4c4d-9062-7d918ff680a1","children":[{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/b5a909ac-6381-4e5b-a36d-5332b5c75f3a\/d8d4e1a2-e376-4309-8823-09fcbe6e8367\/05721452-f665-4c4d-9062-7d918ff680a1\/90499c87-34c4-4df9-9470-ddc9c38c16f5","ref":{"parent":"05721452-f665-4c4d-9062-7d918ff680a1","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"220-13-14-14-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003ENote: To view this Appendix in PDF, click \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/files\/2024-02\/Appendix_C.pdf\u0022\u003EHERE\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"90499c87-34c4-4df9-9470-ddc9c38c16f5","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/b5a909ac-6381-4e5b-a36d-5332b5c75f3a\/d8d4e1a2-e376-4309-8823-09fcbe6e8367\/f3974150-60e2-4f06-9a0f-86b176b33ade","ref":{"parent":"d8d4e1a2-e376-4309-8823-09fcbe6e8367","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h5"},"pos":"220-13-14-15","docId":"75","text":"Appendix D: Examples of How to Measure Sign Area.","id":"f3974150-60e2-4f06-9a0f-86b176b33ade","children":[{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/b5a909ac-6381-4e5b-a36d-5332b5c75f3a\/d8d4e1a2-e376-4309-8823-09fcbe6e8367\/f3974150-60e2-4f06-9a0f-86b176b33ade\/28a49897-5fe7-4b21-a146-5d03acaab324","ref":{"parent":"f3974150-60e2-4f06-9a0f-86b176b33ade","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"220-13-14-15-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003ENote: To view this Appendix in PDF, click \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/files\/2024-02\/Appendix_D.pdf\u0022\u003EHERE\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"28a49897-5fe7-4b21-a146-5d03acaab324","prev_id":null}]}]}]},{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611","ref":{"parent":"d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":1,"tag":"h3"},"pos":"220-14","docId":"75","text":"CHAPTER 19.12: ADMINISTRATION","id":"8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611","children":[{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/27ce284e-5cf2-41b2-ac4f-fb9a999d71d8","ref":{"parent":"8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"220-14-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"27ce284e-5cf2-41b2-ac4f-fb9a999d71d8","prev_id":null},{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/9a17f1c5-0964-468c-9e06-3689c5eff3c1","ref":{"parent":"8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"220-14-12","docId":"75","text":"19.12.010 Purpose and Intent.","id":"9a17f1c5-0964-468c-9e06-3689c5eff3c1","children":[{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/9a17f1c5-0964-468c-9e06-3689c5eff3c1\/12748012-9e1f-4050-9e67-36406d84ed2c","ref":{"parent":"9a17f1c5-0964-468c-9e06-3689c5eff3c1","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"220-14-12-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe purpose and intent of the Administration section is to establish procedures for the discretionary review of development in the City in order to ensure that new development and changes to existing developments comply with City development requirements and policies. This chapter establishes the procedures for review of applications before the approval authorities for each type of project and the process for appeals of any requirement, decision or determination made by any Approval Body.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 14-2125, \u00a7 4 (part), 2014; Ord. 2085, \u00a7 2 (part), 2011)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"12748012-9e1f-4050-9e67-36406d84ed2c","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/12aefda6-04a3-40e4-906a-6bee708dc80c","ref":{"parent":"8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"220-14-13","docId":"75","text":"19.12.020 Applicability of Regulations.","id":"12aefda6-04a3-40e4-906a-6bee708dc80c","children":[{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/12aefda6-04a3-40e4-906a-6bee708dc80c\/b7e0fe6f-669c-4dc0-93c3-124f64ba1869","ref":{"parent":"12aefda6-04a3-40e4-906a-6bee708dc80c","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"220-14-13-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EExcept as otherwise provided in this section, Development Review is required for all zoning map and text amendments, new construction, modifications to building exteriors or site improvements, and changes in land use, including, but not limited to, the following:\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the A, A1, R-1 and RHS Zones, the following activities:\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EConditional uses in accord with Chapter 19.20, Chapter 19.24, Chapter 19.28, and Chapter 19.40;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERemoval of protected trees identified in Chapter 14.18;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProjects in R-1 zones identified in Section 19.28.040;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeight Exceptions identified in Section 19.24.050(B)(3);\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHillside Exceptions identified in Section 19.440.070, Section 19.40.050, and Chapter 19.48;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EParking Exceptions identified in Chapter 19.124;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFence Exceptions identified in Chapter 19.48;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVariance to all other zoning regulations.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn R-2, R-3, R-4, R1C, TH and all Commercial, Industrial, Office, Planned Zoning Districts, and other non-residential zoning districts:\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENew structures or property development, including signs and sign programs.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuilding additions, exterior modifications to existing structures including signs and sign programs, and site changes (including, but not limited to, new or modified landscaping, tree removals, fencing, changes to parking lot space striping or circulation);\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChanges in property or building use that involve exterior modifications;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExceptions or modifications to the development\u0027s required and\/or existing parking;\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EConditional uses in accord with Chapter 19.20, Chapter 19.32, Chapter 19.36, Chapter 19.38, Chapter 19.44, Chapter 19.46, Chapter 19.60, Chapter 19.64, Chapter 19.68, Chapter 19.72, Chapter 19.76, Chapter 19.80, Chapter 19.84, Chapter 19.88, Chapter 19.92, Chapter 19.96, Chapter 19.128, Chapter 19.116, Chapter 19.132, Chapter 19.136.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 14-2125, \u00a7 4 (part), 2014; Ord. 2085, \u00a7 2 (part), 2011; Ord. 24-2261, \u00a7 1 (part), 2024)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"b7e0fe6f-669c-4dc0-93c3-124f64ba1869","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/9cc2272c-35b7-4f08-a849-c398ebe1a3e0","ref":{"parent":"8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":1,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"220-14-14","docId":"75","text":"19.12.030 Approval Authority.","id":"9cc2272c-35b7-4f08-a849-c398ebe1a3e0","children":[{"path":"\/d3ef8742-594e-4e92-bb0d-0fbb09d855bd\/8e9db1da-9e3d-4957-bb91-62eb351c0611\/9cc2272c-35